# What can you do?

::: {.incremental}
* Learn/read about reliable research practices
* Encourage advisors and students to engage in reliabile research practices
* Propose to conduct a replication
* Conduct a meta-analysis
* Join a big team science team
* Learn R and/or Python
* Pet a dog
:::



